== Build docker image before first time building hedgewars:

> docker build --progress=plain -t win-hedgewarsbe .

== To build hedgewars using this image:

> docker-compose run --rm build

Collect artifacts in out/ folder

== The game server is not built by default. To build it too, the image needs
== the Haskell toolchain, which is left out unless asked for:

> docker build --progress=plain --build-arg BUILD_SERVER=1 -t win-hedgewarsbe .
> BUILD_SERVER=1 docker-compose run --rm build

